test/runTest.js`; covers activation, view registration, and per-subview render under happy/empty/error.\n- **R78** (Phase 10 frontend review): all required headings (Spec alignment, Coding-standard alignment, UI-specification compliance walking ui-specification.md sections explicitly, i18n coverage, Findings, Verdict).\n- **R79** (Extension↔Daemon contract gate): introduces `extension/src/test/contract.test.ts`; required headings (Contract surfaces, Round-trip evidence, Schema surfaces, Findings, Verdict).\n- **T80–T84** (Phase 11 hardening tests): large-repo perf (with P99 budgets from Phases 1+2), concurrency (parallel sessions / write contention / replay-safe), recovery + corruption, partial-index + workspace-boundary (per spec §Non-Negotiable Product Properties), migration + MCP schema compat regression (uses R64 shims).\n- **T85** (documentation suite): all eleven required docs from spec §Documentation Requirements.\n- **T86** (runbook + recovery playbook): quotes the `pkill -f lattice && cp daemon/target/release/lattice extension/bin/ && cp daemon/target/release/lattice ~/.vscode/extensions/lattice.lattice-0.1.0/bin/` sequence from `lattice/CLAUDE.md` and documents the replay-from-snapshot procedure validated by T82.\n- **R87** (Phase 11 hardening + docs review): required headings including Doc coverage matrix (one row per required doc from spec §Documentation Requirements) and Hardening evidence.\n- **R88** (Definition-of-Done gate): all nine checklist sections from `shared/templates/definition-of-done-checklist.md`; `## Explicit Deferrals` must be empty or list each deferral with reason+owner+target-date per the execution philosophy in `/home/pete/.claude/CLAUDE.md`.\n- **R89** (Final readiness review): required matrices (Spec coverage by phase, Measurable success criteria with evidence file paths, Risk controls in place with implementation+test evidence), plus a binding Ship verdict (PASS or BLOCK). Verification runs full `cargo test --workspace` and extension compile/lint/test.\n\nNo code in `daemon/` or `extension/` was modified. `tasks.json`, `context.md`, and `plan.md` were not modified."}],"totalDurationMs":987098,"totalTokens":160303,"totalToolUseCount":45,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":825,"cache_read_input_tokens":158112,"output_tokens":1365,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":825},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1365,"cache_read_input_tokens":158112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":825,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":825,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":15,"searchCount":2,"bashCount":9,"editFileCount":19,"linesAdded":1605,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
