docs/architecture/2026-05-16-memory-migration-guide.md:48:| `freshness_policy` | `memories.freshness_policy_json`; scope fallback | Legacy enum maps to `FreshnessPolicy.kind`; `time_bound` receives a 30 day TTL and 7 day recheck interval. | Unknown values use the stream default policy. | Not dropped. |
docs/architecture/2026-05-16-memory-migration-guide.md:51:| `evidence_json` | `memories.evidence_references_json`, `memory_evidence` | JSON array is preserved in references JSON; each entry becomes `memory_evidence` with a synthetic event-reference anchor. | Invalid JSON skips the row. Empty array produces no evidence rows. | Not dropped. |
docs/architecture/2026-05-16-memory-migration-guide.md:52:| `created_at` | `memories.created_at`, derived graph row timestamps, `memory_scores.computed_at` | Copied as epoch seconds. | Required. | Not dropped. |
docs/architecture/2026-05-16-memory-migration-guide.md:53:| `last_accessed` | `memories.updated_at`, `memory_accesses.accessed_at`, `access_history_json` | `updated_at` is `max(created_at, last_accessed)`. | Required. | Not dropped. |
docs/architecture/2026-05-16-memory-migration-guide.md:54:| `access_count` | `memory_accesses`, `memory_scores.sample_size`, `access_history_json` | Positive values create one summarized access row and score sample size. | `0` creates no access row. Negative values are treated as `0` for score sample size. | Not dropped. |
docs/architecture/2026-05-16-memory-migration-guide.md:55:| `is_stale` | `memories.verification_status` | Non-zero forces `stale`. | Default `0`. | Not dropped. |
