+# T71 Result
+
+## Files created/modified
+
+- Modified `extension/package.json`
+- Modified `extension/src/extension.ts`
+- Created `extension/.eslintrc.json`
+- Created `extension/resources/review-panel.svg`
+- Created `extension/src/review/i18n/en.json`
