+
+Run `npm audit` for details.
+```
+
+### `cd extension && npm run compile`
+
+```text
+> lattice@0.1.0 compile
+> tsc -p ./
+```
+
+Result: passed with exit code 0.
+
+### `cd extension && npm run lint`
+
+```text
+> lattice@0.1.0 lint
+> eslint src --ext ts
+```
+
+Result: passed with exit code 0.
+
+### Additional checks
+
+```text
+wc -l extension/src/review/reviewPanel.ts extension/src/review/rpcBridge.ts
+  535 extension/src/review/reviewPanel.ts
+  481 extension/src/review/rpcBridge.ts
+ 1016 total
+```
+
+Result: passed with both task-scoped files under the 800-line ceiling.
+
+```text
+rg -n 'TODO|FIXME|XXX|window\.confirm|window\.prompt|window\.alert|eslint-disable' extension/src/review extension/package.json extension/.eslintrc.json -S
+```
+
+Result: passed with exit code 1, which in this case means no matches were found.
+
+### Deploy steps
+
+```text
+pkill -f lattice && sleep 2; cp daemon/target/release/lattice extension/bin/ && cp daemon/target/release/lattice ~/.vscode/extensions/lattice.lattice-0.1.0/bin/
+```
+
+Result: exited with code 143 after `pkill -f lattice`, so the copy portion was re-run separately.
+
+```text
+cp daemon/target/release/lattice extension/bin/
+cp daemon/target/release/lattice ~/.vscode/extensions/lattice.lattice-0.1.0/bin/
+```
+
+Result: both copy commands passed with exit code 0.
+
+## Issues encountered
+
+- `reviewPanel.ts` initially failed TypeScript parsing because an inline webview helper contained an unescaped backtick inside the template literal. The helper was simplified so the generated script parses cleanly.
+- `npm run lint` initially failed before linting any source because the extension directory had no ESLint configuration at all. A minimal repo-local `.eslintrc.json` was added so the declared verification command is executable and stable.
+- The first deploy attempt exited with code 143 because `pkill -f lattice` terminated before the chained copy commands ran. The two copy commands were then executed separately and succeeded.
+
+## Final status
+
+complete
